Z||000011||overlord||07-09-2001||01:14 PM||||im currently running bosche platinum +4 plugs in my 84. Seems to be working well.<BR>I noticed when i switched from regualar cheapie plugs to bosche platinum (regular) that the car ran way better.||||reg||1
